<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Defs_L3_3_1_2" targetNamespace="https://teck.example/process-models/pillar-03">
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collab_L3_3_1_2">
    <bpmn:participant id="Pool_L3_3_1_2" name="3.1.2 Secondary/Tertiary Crushing &amp; Screening" processRef="Process_L3_3_1_2"/>
  </bpmn:collaboration>
  <bpmn:process id="Process_L3_3_1_2" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation>L0/L2 Process. Not all circuits include secondary/tertiary crushing. Where present (typically in three-stage crushing circuits preceding ball mills, or as pebble crushers in SABC circuits), screens classify crushed product and recirculate oversize. This sub-process is conditional — it applies where a dedicated crushing circuit precedes ball milling. [Configuration: SABC circuits use pebble crushing (3.1.2.3); three-stage crushing circuits use 3.1.2.1 and 3.1.2.2 before ball milling.]</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="LaneSet_L3_3_1_2">
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L3_3_1_2_dcs" name="DCS Auto-control / Control Room Operator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Start_L3_3_1_2_s</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Service_L3_3_1_2_3_1_2_1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gw_L3_3_1_2_g</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Service_L3_3_1_2_3_1_2_2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_L3_3_1_2_e</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Start_L3_3_1_2_s2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Service_L3_3_1_2_3_1_2_3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_L3_3_1_2_e2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_L3_3_1_2_s" name="Crusher product at screen">
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_1_2_1</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Service_L3_3_1_2_3_1_2_1" name="3.1.2.1 Classify Ore by Screen">
      <bpmn:documentation>Vibrating screen deck(s) classify crushed ore by particle size. Oversize material (&gt; screen aperture) is retained and recycled to crusher. Undersize passes through as the screened product. Screen efficiency (partition curve) and circulating load percentage are key process parameters. Screen deck vibration, throughput, and feed/product size are monitored.
ISA-95 level: 0 / 2
Actors: DCS Auto-control
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 0, 2
DDVC layer: Raw</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_1_2_1</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_1_2_5</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_1_2_2</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gw_L3_3_1_2_g" name="Oversize retained?" default="Flow_L3_3_1_2_4">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_1_2_2</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_1_2_3</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_1_2_4</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Service_L3_3_1_2_3_1_2_2" name="3.1.2.2 Execute Secondary/Tertiary Crushing">
      <bpmn:documentation>Cone or impact crusher reduces screen oversize to within specification. Multiple stages may be applied (secondary then tertiary). Crusher power, throughput, and gap setting are monitored continuously. [Configuration: in a three-stage circuit — primary jaw, secondary cone, tertiary cone — this precedes ball mill grinding where there is no SAG mill.]
ISA-95 level: 0 / 2
Actors: DCS Auto-control
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 0, 2
DDVC layer: Raw (time-series: secondary_crusher_telemetry)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_1_2_3</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_1_2_5</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_L3_3_1_2_e" name="Screened product forward">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_1_2_4</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_L3_3_1_2_s2" name="Pebbles above threshold at SAG discharge screen">
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_1_2_6</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Service_L3_3_1_2_3_1_2_3" name="3.1.2.3 Execute Pebble Crushing">
      <bpmn:documentation>Pebble crusher handles the "critical size" fraction (typically 20–80 mm) generated by the SAG mill that is too large for efficient ball milling and too small to act as grinding media. Pebbles are diverted from the SAG discharge screen and fed to a cone crusher (pebble crusher); crushed product is returned to the SAG mill feed or ball mill feed. [Configuration: applies to SABC circuits, where pebble build-up is a key SAG throughput constraint; not applicable to three-stage crushing circuits without a SAG mill.]
ISA-95 level: 0 / 2
Actors: DCS Auto-control
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 0, 2
DDVC layer: Raw</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_1_2_6</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_1_2_7</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_L3_3_1_2_e2" name="Pebbles returned to circuit">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_1_2_7</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_1_2_1" sourceRef="Start_L3_3_1_2_s" targetRef="Service_L3_3_1_2_3_1_2_1"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_1_2_2" sourceRef="Service_L3_3_1_2_3_1_2_1" targetRef="Gw_L3_3_1_2_g"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_1_2_3" name="Yes" sourceRef="Gw_L3_3_1_2_g" targetRef="Service_L3_3_1_2_3_1_2_2"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_1_2_4" name="No" sourceRef="Gw_L3_3_1_2_g" targetRef="End_L3_3_1_2_e"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_1_2_5" sourceRef="Service_L3_3_1_2_3_1_2_2" targetRef="Service_L3_3_1_2_3_1_2_1"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_1_2_6" sourceRef="Start_L3_3_1_2_s2" targetRef="Service_L3_3_1_2_3_1_2_3"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_1_2_7" sourceRef="Service_L3_3_1_2_3_1_2_3" targetRef="End_L3_3_1_2_e2"/>
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="Diagram_L3_3_1_2">
    <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="Plane_L3_3_1_2" bpmnElement="Collab_L3_3_1_2">
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Pool_L3_3_1_2_di" bpmnElement="Pool_L3_3_1_2" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="20" y="20" width="710" height="510"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L3_3_1_2_dcs_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L3_3_1_2_dcs" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="20" width="670" height="510"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Start_L3_3_1_2_s_di" bpmnElement="Start_L3_3_1_2_s"><dc:Bounds x="110" y="77" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="88" y="139" width="100" height="42"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Service_L3_3_1_2_3_1_2_1_di" bpmnElement="Service_L3_3_1_2_3_1_2_1"><dc:Bounds x="202" y="65" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Gw_L3_3_1_2_g_di" bpmnElement="Gw_L3_3_1_2_g" isMarkerVisible="true"><dc:Bounds x="458" y="70" width="70" height="70"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="443" y="36" width="100" height="28"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Service_L3_3_1_2_3_1_2_2_di" bpmnElement="Service_L3_3_1_2_3_1_2_2"><dc:Bounds x="408" y="235" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_L3_3_1_2_e_di" bpmnElement="End_L3_3_1_2_e"><dc:Bounds x="614" y="77" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="592" y="139" width="100" height="42"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Start_L3_3_1_2_s2_di" bpmnElement="Start_L3_3_1_2_s2"><dc:Bounds x="110" y="417" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="88" y="479" width="100" height="84"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Service_L3_3_1_2_3_1_2_3_di" bpmnElement="Service_L3_3_1_2_3_1_2_3"><dc:Bounds x="202" y="405" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_L3_3_1_2_e2_di" bpmnElement="End_L3_3_1_2_e2"><dc:Bounds x="465" y="417" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="443" y="479" width="100" height="42"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_1_2_1_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_1_2_1"><di:waypoint x="166" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="202" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_1_2_2_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_1_2_2"><di:waypoint x="372" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="458" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_1_2_3_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_1_2_3"><di:waypoint x="493" y="140"/><di:waypoint x="493" y="235"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="499" y="144" width="27" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_1_2_4_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_1_2_4"><di:waypoint x="528" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="614" y="105"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="532" y="85" width="21" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_1_2_5_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_1_2_5"><di:waypoint x="408" y="275"/><di:waypoint x="287" y="275"/><di:waypoint x="287" y="145"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_1_2_6_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_1_2_6"><di:waypoint x="166" y="445"/><di:waypoint x="202" y="445"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_1_2_7_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_1_2_7"><di:waypoint x="372" y="445"/><di:waypoint x="465" y="445"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
    </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
  </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
</bpmn:definitions>
